$DATUM 2-({5-Methyl-1-[2-(5-methyl-2-furyl)ethyl]-1H-pyrrol-2-yl}methyl)-1H-isoindole-1,3(2H)-dione
(6r). A soln of diketone 4b (2.86 g, 11 mmol) and 2-(2-furyl)ethanamine
(1.38 g, 11 mmol) in EtOH (30 mL) was refluxed for 1 h (TLC monitoring).
The solvent was evaporated and the residue was recrystallized
(EtOAc-acetone). white solid; yield: 2.50 g (65%). mp 137-138 °C. IR
(KBr): 1716, 1568, 1468, 1424, 1388, 1332, 1304, 1204, 1096, 1020, 932,
808, 780, 748 cm-1. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 2.15 (s, 3 H, Me), 2.26
(s, 3 H, Me), 2.87 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 2 H, CH2), 4.29 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 2 H,
CH2), 4.69 (s, 2 H, CH2), 5.80 (d, J = 3.6 Hz, 1 H, HPyr), 5.85 (d, J =
3.3 Hz, 1 H, HFur), 5.89 (d, J = 3.3 Hz, 1 H, HFur), 6.17 (d, J = 3.6 Hz,
1 H, HPyr), 7.64-7.71 (m, 2 H, HPht), 7.76-7.84 (m, 2 H, HPht). MS (EI,
70 eV): m/z (%) = 348 (42) [M+], 253 (23), 241 (13), 201 (12), 160 (44),
106 (100), 94 (17), 79 (18), 65 (15), 53 (12). Anal. Calcd for C21H20N2O3
: C, 72.40; H, 5.79; N, 8.04. Found: C, 72.44; H, 5.66; N, 8.11.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
